    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703110/extras/d52970667a55976755de0691bcd2bdf4.avif?t=1752709880\" width=600 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You finally booked a stay at the legendary Castle Lustelia\u2026 but disaster strikes again! Your precious hentai cards have vanished \u2014 scattered throughout the enchanted hotel by someone with a very naughty sense of humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander through a lavish medieval castle-hotel and uncover your missing cards hidden in the most mischievous spots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peek behind tapestries, open ancient chests, lift pillows on royal beds \u2013 no corner is safe from secrets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock seductive new artwork and rebuild your precious deck, one spicy discovery at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a cheeky, sensual, and delightfully absurd treasure hunt! Can you find them all before checkout?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703110/extras/7b5ea6de79e6afbc62ddef39d1149d4f.avif?t=1752709880\" width=1200 height=194 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 Sensual Cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 Interactive Rooms in a Medieval Hotel </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with One Hand </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller Support</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703110/extras/d52970667a55976755de0691bcd2bdf4.avif?t=1752709880\" width=600 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You finally booked a stay at the legendary Castle Lustelia\u2026 but disaster strikes again! Your precious hentai cards have vanished \u2014 scattered throughout the enchanted hotel by someone with a very naughty sense of humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander through a lavish medieval castle-hotel and uncover your missing cards hidden in the most mischievous spots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peek behind tapestries, open ancient chests, lift pillows on royal beds \u2013 no corner is safe from secrets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock seductive new artwork and rebuild your precious deck, one spicy discovery at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a cheeky, sensual, and delightfully absurd treasure hunt! Can you find them all before checkout?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703110/extras/7b5ea6de79e6afbc62ddef39d1149d4f.avif?t=1752709880\" width=1200 height=194 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 Sensual Cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 Interactive Rooms in a Medieval Hotel </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with One Hand </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller Support</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Someone scattered your precious hentai deck all over the castle hotel! Search every corner, from behind ancient curtains to inside treasure chests, and recover your lost cards. Explore 3D medieval-themed rooms, unlock spicy artwork, and complete your collection in this naughty hide-and-seek game!",
